# Evidence pack folder — Phase 1
# 
# Each completed slice/day drops evidence here:
#   day-31-rehearsal/            full proof rehearsal screenshots + notes
#   day-37-batch-evidence/       import batch screenshots + counts
#   day-38-demo-script/          1D closeout demo script + recording
#   import-batch-<id>-<date>/    each production import
#
# DO NOT commit raw patient data. Only:
#   - aggregate counts (created/skipped/failed)
#   - sanitised screenshots (no NHI visible, no real names)
#   - decision notes
#   - audit log spot-checks (action types, no patient identifiers)
